<title>CANADA: Imperial Oil lowers Canada oil prices.</title>
<headline>Imperial Oil lowers Canada oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Oil Ltd said it lowered the price it would pay for Edmonton light sweet crude oil by C$7.00/cubic metre or C$1.11/barrel, to C$187.00/cubic metre or C$29.73/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Other new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$181.00/cubic metre, or C$28.78/barrel</p>
<p>Bow River at Hardisty C$154.00/cubic metre, or C$24.48/barrel</p>
<p>Midale at Cromer C$160.00/cubic metre, or C$25.44/barrel</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
